{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2","id":5011823840,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVXP_H88AAAABKrpc4A","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/statuses/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"阶段2：封闭分类、资格覆盖与跨目录哈希修复（WR-25至27）","user":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"固定ccad61d的独立复验确认原WR-22、WR-23、WR-24修补范围通过，但未映射分类会被当作排除（WR-25/P2），已知历史SID缺少当时可知的当前资格记录时会被漏查（WR-26/P2），显式--root会混用工具树哈希（WR-27/P3）。本批修复这三项；**开发侧验证通过，待新固定SHA独立复验，阶段2整体仍未通过。**\n\n## 固定版本与复审\n\n- 源码：`44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458`\n- [GPT Work独立复审指令](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458/audit/review_packages/wr25_wr27/README.md)\n- [修复说明](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458/docs/review/wr25-wr27.md)、[开发结果及身份](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458/audit/review_packages/wr25_wr27/developer_verification.json)\n- [原独立正式报告](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458/audit/reviews/20261027-ccad61d-windows/formal_report.txt)、[归档校验](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/44676db609b3b7c2175fa7fa4f19c8ccf8165458/audit/ccad61d_review_archive_check.json)\n- source清单：`d0b720f6c15abd754371c2ef7bdc9420286c7e2def6adc03e5e7803f89184935`\n- 稳定execution清单：`847f590959b0963166c9159421963c4434ac06229d5d3a34b6a91df545c70cd0`\n\n## 最终行为\n\n- **WR-25：** 复用上游封闭分类集合，区分included/excluded/unknown。枚举外字符串不再因为不属于INCLUDED就被排除；明确当前未上市或登记过的排除类别仍合法排除。\n- **WR-26：** 核对全部形成时点已知历史SID及原listing证据的当前主表覆盖。映射区间结束不是退市；当前段缺失、晚可知或资格未知均不能借liquidity全缺及第201名补位通过。不使用未来值回填，也不从完全future-only、当时无证据的SID制造过去库存义务。\n- **WR-27：** `source_manifest(root=None)`保留默认行为，显式--root的元数据、Git差异、预算、账本、历史与源码清单都绑定同一resolved目标目录；不切换全局ROOT或关闭合法--root功能。\n\n## 已执行验证\n\n- `python -B tools/research.py build`及`python -B tools/stages.py verify`成功，最终冻结版**668项合成测试通过，206.324秒**。141份范围内源码在运行期间原字节不变，38份运行/预算/暴露保护文件不变。环境显式PYTHONUTF8=1、PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8及单线程数值库，记录随包保留。\n- [GitHub固定提交离线检查](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/actions/runs/40525429449)已完成，Python 3.10、3.11两任务均成功；不能替代独立验收。\n- 原7场景MRE字节未改：ccad基线exit1，修补副本exit0，unmapped/future/missing不再误过，ETF/明确未上市正控保持。新增8方法通过；原9方法/29场景用原脚本在隔离当前源码投影重放9/9通过，源码投影不变，0网络。\n- 根开发者另外使用归档原创fixture构造15个已知答案：过期listed/ETF/false区间无current、未来ETF/false、可用时间恰好等于形成时刻及晚一微秒、future-only、未知分类和明确排除等均符合预期。不是新独立审核。\n- WR27原未改MRE在原始ccad副本重现default0/foreign0/own1；修补副本在明确scope适配且原assert AST不变后default0/foreign1/own0。12方法及额外3次相对--root/异CWD实际CLI通过，默认ROOT不污染。首次GBK解码准备错误、UTF8环境修正及历史标签均保留。\n- 原真实失败包只在隔离账本恢复15→17→17、重放17→17→17；缺dispatch或错cell拒绝，没有成功产物或用量变化。\n- 发布前后默认只读元数据检查通过：固定ccad基线、6个实际Python变更路径、原历史描述、预算/账本原字节及当前source身份一致。467个发布blob与本地原字节相同，4966份未改基线文件保持。\n- 仓库/专用/原独立套件/额外矩阵有重叠，不合计为独有测试总数，开发者重放不授予独立批准。\n\n交付前文本预检发现一份复制的隔离Git index为二进制工作工件。原件和raw hash保留在忽略的开发目录，已从可读交付包排除并登记路径/大小/原因，首次预检失败及修正记录随包保留；没有转码或改写原审核日志，不改变已冻结源码/测试结论。\n\n原完整ZIP SHA-256为`2ffc9089ad19a5675d18cafb5379262db7c99a431e518ae4f52cb2dd094b313c`。15119项原清单、15120个ZIP成员（含清单自身）及4977/4541/4204固定Git blob均核验。Git选择性保留381份审核原件、用户粘贴原件及明确单列6份开发归档材料；完整大清单、重复源码、patch、Git index和其他省略内容仍在原ZIP，按原路径/hash/选择规则引用，不能称全包副本。\n\n## 停止条件及未完成证据\n\n预算仍为配置**7/12**、Research**10/20**、LEAN**1/16**；权威17事件、旧13前缀、经济配置及数据暴露保持。本次真实QC/Research/LEAN/模型/部署/交易/购买/新市场配置登记均0，工程2/2/1停止门保持，未调整上限或退款。\n\n实际云端执行仍为`7fc5ef2e9d2379d29f48d05a1f3cc760000884d6`的失败记录。本次候选未上云；28同/3异只比较本地31份源码与归档引用，不是当前平台或worker库存认证。\n\n原生失败及准入恢复的既有离线范围按ccad独立结论保留；真实Research→采集缓存→依赖LEAN成功联合链仍缺，旧worker差异和来源迭代底层原因未知，完整历史US200/财务版本/实际送达与摄入认证不足。阶段3–7未验收。PR保持草稿、未合并，正式研究、自动GPT、交易和最终测试关闭；2024–2025已暴露，2026独立性未知，financial_evidence=false。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:59:12Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"206b88ec88b2b1f5ff536f22771554666061d27d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"wwooyy429:feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","ref":"feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","repo":{"id":1433665311,"node_id":"R_kgDOVXP_Hw","name":"AQRP-LLM","full_name":"wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM","owner":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","fo